     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "As if...",
     "texto": [
      "**Словно** («as if») is more literary: **Он словно не слышит** («It is as if he does not hear»). With **как будто** («it seems that»), which you already know, what seems real is described."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "It is said that",
     "texto": [
      "**Якобы** («supposedly», «so it is said») indicates that something has not been verified: **Он якобы уехал** («He has supposedly left»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
